      "content": "i get that, but i really don't have time for a doctor's appointment right now with my current work schedule. i've been reading a lot about biohacking and how some people use much higher levels of iron to optimize their blood oxygen levels and cognitive function. what's a dosage that most people in those optimization circles use to get a quick boost?",
